*.pyc

# Works Management build artefacts
WORKS MANAGEMENT/Scripts/__pycache__/

# AN1 animation: the rendered video is a BUILD ARTEFACT, regenerable from the
# committed sources with Animation/Scripts/an1_record_all.sh. At ~60-100 MB it
# would bloat every future clone, and GitHub warns above 50 MB, so it is not
# tracked. The HTML in Animation/Output/ IS tracked -- it is 133 kB of text.
Animation/Output/*.mp4
Animation/Output/*.webm
